cal robot is connected.\n\nEverything runs client-side and is seeded + replayable. Robots follow the oracle-verified plan \u2014 no learned-policy result is claimed. A verdict means \"reproducible under this verifier,\" never \"safe.\" Synthetic layout.\n\n2D floor\n3D\nPause\nStep\nRestart\nNew layout\nRobots\n4\nFINISH\nAll 4 orders fulfilled with zero collisions, yielding 1\u00d7 to the human \u2014 reproducible under this verifier.\n4/4\norders fulfilled\n0\ncollisions (invariant)\n1\nyields to human\n1\nrobot\u2013robot yields\n30\nticks \u00b7 t=27\nA-17 \u00b7 finish\nB-04 \u00b7 finish\nC-92 \u00b7 finish\nD-33 \u00b7 finish\nSign this run \u2192 Sigil\n\nThe robots follow the oracle-verified plan (Origin\u2019s deterministic bfsOracle, finish/escalate/refuse) and a deterministic coordinator keeps every executed step collision-free and people-first \u2014 so a whole run is reproducible under this verifier and drops a signed Sigil you can re-check offline. We claim no learned-policy result: this visualizes a verified plan executing, not a trained model. Synthetic layout; seeded + replayable.\n\norigin\n\nMove AI forward.\nWith evidence.\n\nWorking prototypes. Explicit limits.\nOffline re-verification.\n\nPRODUCT\n\nRun a policy reference check\nVerify an attestation\nRun the verifiers\nTrust center\nReference check vs runtime\n\nCOMPANY\n\nOne-page brief\nProving ground\nLabs\nEvidence traces\nFor AI agents\nSource on GitHub \u2197\n\u00a9 2026 Origin\nPrivacy\nTerms\nContact\nOwner console","robots":"","viewport":{"width":375,"height":812,"scrollWidth":375,"scrollHeight":3055},"overflow":[],"headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Watch a verified plan execute."}],"landmarks":[{"selector":"header.site-header","label":null,"text":"origin Run reference check"},{"selector":"#main","label":null,"text":"ONE EVIDENCE SPINE, TWO ACTORS \u00b7 THE PHYSICAL ACTOR Watch a verified plan execute. Watch a deterministic plan play out in a seeded warehouse simulation. Inspect paths, constraints "},{"selector":"footer.site-footer","label":null,"text":"origin Move AI forward. With evidence. Working prototypes. Explicit limits. Offline re-verification. PRODUCT Run a policy reference check Verify an attestation Run the verifiers Tr"},{"selector":"nav.site-footer__nav","label":"Footer","text":"PRODUCT Run a policy reference check Verify an attestation Run the verifiers Trust center Reference check vs runtime COMPANY One-page brief Proving ground Labs Evidence traces For "}],"links":[{"text":"Skip to main content","href":"#main"},{"text":"origin","href":"/"},{"text":"Run reference check","href":"/reference-check"},{"text":"origin","href":"/"},{"text":"Run a policy reference check","href":"/reference-check"},{"text":"Verify an attestation","href":"/verify"},{"text":"Run the verifiers","href":"/security"},{"text":"Trust center","href":"/trust"},{"text":"Reference check vs runtime","href":"/reference-check-vs-runtime"},{"text":"One-page brief","href":"/brief"},{"text":"Proving ground","href":"/proving-ground"},{"text":"Labs","href":"/labs"},{"text":"Evidence traces","href":"/proof"},{"text":"For AI agents","href":"/llms.txt"},{"text":"Source on GitHub \u2197","href":"https://github.com/bohueilin/Origin"},{"text":"Privacy","href":"/legal/privacy-policy.html"},{"text":"Terms","href":"/legal/terms-of-service.html"},{"text":"Contact","href":"mailto:bohueilin@gmail.com"},{"text":"Owner console","href":"/auth"}],"images":[{"src":"/brand/origin-mark.svg","alt":"","caption":"","loading":"auto","priority":"auto","x":24,"y":23,"width":28,"height":28},{"src":"/brand/origin-mark.svg","alt":"","caption":"","loading":"auto","priority":"auto","x":24,"y":2417.796875,"width":28,"height":28}],"typography":[{"selector":"a.skip-link","tag":"a","text":"Skip to main content","size":16,"lineHeight":"25.6px","weight":"400","color":"rgb(255, 255, 255)","background":"rgb(39, 45, 38)","font":"\"Avenir Next\", Avenir, system-ui, -apple-system, \"Segoe UI\", sans-serif","width":18